    description: "After W4 (strict mode) lands and the bulk of the codebase is clean, sweep the remaining `# type: ignore` comments. For each: (a) is it still needed? (b) does it have the specific error code `[error-code]`? (c) is the underlying issue actually a bug to fix or a justified suppression? Replace bare `# type: ignore` with codes; remove no-longer-needed suppressions; convert genuine-bug suppressions into tracker items."  # 9b4c
